tered memories leave his current role unresolved.","birthplace":"Ignis Peaks","psychology":["Craves intense combat","Disdains weaker powers","Seeks powerful opponents"],"motivations":["Experience intense combat","Fully express his power"],"personality":["Battle-hungry","Chaotic","Arrogant","Destructive","Possessive"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":["Likes battle","Likes powerful opponents","Dislikes restrained power"],"majorLifeEvents":"Raised at Ignis Peaks\nBonded with Ignis through combat\nProtected infant Ash\nDelivered Ash to Hecate''s great-aunt\nMemories altered\nDisappeared"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4/portrait/1790356514399-rahim-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Ignis\nLeviathans","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Ife\nEzra\nRuchika\nAsh","worldConnections":"Ignis Peaks","relationshipNotes":"Ife shares both parents with Rahim and manifests the same Fire and Water lineage as Steam rather than Blood. Rahim protected Ash as an infant and delivered Ash safely to Hecate''s great-aunt before disappearing."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f6cff800-4029-4f02-b391-098583082feb","realm_record_id":"97d4dc51-d1bf-4f80-9e77-3955ba9dad35","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"7f13ea09-709b-4aff-8d52-e65832afb12b","faction_record_id":null}','2026-09-25T17:16:43.882164+00:00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id,entity_type,entity_id,entity_label,changed_by,changed_by_email,snapshot,created_at) VALUES ('36206fc5-52f7-4de4-a393-2716c136b372','studio_characters','7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662','AshóNodia','db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745','Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com','{"id":"7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662","name":"AshóNodia","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nBirthplace\nHeight\nWeight\nDominant hand","canonLocks":"Age appearance 15–16\nSame loc hairstyle\nWarm brown skin\nEmerald green eyes\nRectangular pupils\nBlack layered clothing\nGreen witch magic\nAsh-based draconic power\nBlack Ash Dragon form","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing references establish Ash''s human, pseudo-dragon, and full Ash Dragon designs.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Use the established teenage production design as the primary reference. Ash should consistently appear approximately 15–16 years old. His magic visuals should emphasize black ash and green witch energy rather than conventional fire.","referenceArtUrl":"","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"15–16","era":"","name":"AshóNodia","race":"Half Human + Half Dragon","alias":"Ashle","gender":"Male","titles":"The Ash Dragon\nThe Lost Son","subrace":"Dragonkin","summary":"AshóNodia is the hidden son of Ignis and Hecate. Raised under the name Ashle by his great-aunt, he inherited an unusual expression of his father''s draconic lineage: ash rather than conventional fire. His witch heritage allows him to magically ignite and manipulate that ash. Emotionally volatile and immensely powerful, Ash struggles with abandonment, belonging, and controlling abilities he was never properly taught to use.","heritage":"Duskari + Faelite","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"Ash","occupation":"","affiliation":"Kaelen''s Crew","apparentAge":"15–16","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":"Fire + Witch Magic"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Massive raw output\nArea control\nMagic disruption\nClose-range destruction\nDraconic durability\nAsh versatility","weaknesses":"Emotional instability\nPoor power control\nHigh collateral risk","combatStyle":["Aggressive","Instinctive","Area-of-effect","Close-range","Overwhelming force"],"limitations":["Does not naturally produce conventional fire","Power intensifies with emotion","Rampages impair judgment","Requires emotional regulation"],"powerSource":["Draconic blood","Hecate''s witch lineage","Ley-line magic"],"abilityNotes":"Despite being the son of Ignis, Ash does not display conventional fire-dragon properties. His inherited fire affinity manifests as ash, the residue of fire, rather than ordinary flame. Hecate''s witchcraft allows him to ignite the ash itself, producing burning enchanted ash without turning Ash into a conventional pyromancer.\n\nAshóNodia is his true name. His great-aunt gave him the everyday name Ashle, shortened to Ash.","combatProfile":"Ash fights through overwhelming pressure rather than refined technique. He floods the battlefield with ash, controls its movement through witchcraft, and can ignite it magically when attacking. His emotional state directly affects his control, making prolonged rage increasingly dangerous to allies and surroundings.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Pseudo Dragon Form\nAsh Dragon Form","primaryAbilities":"Ash Manipulation\nWitch-Ignited Ash\nFumemancy\nMagic Dampening","secondaryAbilities":"Smoke Manipulation\nSoot Manipulation\nEmber Manipulation\nAsh Solidification\nLey-Line Sensitivity\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Speed\nEnhanced Durability\nDraconic Senses","signatureTechniques":"Dragon''s Roar\nIncinerating Blast\nCinder Step\nVolcanic Burst\nAsh Cloud\nSilent Cinder Field","transformationDetails":"Ash''s pseudo form develops horns, black scales, claws, a tail, and increased draconic physical ability. His full dragon form becomes a massive black Ash Dragon surrounded by drifting ash and green witch energy. His draconic manifestation emphasizes ash rather than conventional flame."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Lean","Athletic"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Emerald green"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Hooded jackets\nDark fitted shirts\nUtility trousers\nCombat boots","hairColor":["Light brown"],"hairStyle":"Layered medium-length locs with loose face-framing strands","accessories":"Green pendant\nLayered necklaces\nUtility belts\nEar piercings","faceDetails":["Youthful angular face","Defined cheekbones"],"hairTexture":["Locs"],"colorPalette":"Black\nCharcoal\nAsh gray\nEmerald green\nEarth brown","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nCharcoal\nEmerald green","alternateForm":["Pseudo Dragon Form","Ash Dragon Form"],"clothingStyle":"Dark layered street-fantasy clothing built for movement and combat.","appearanceNotes":"Ash retains the same loc hairstyle throughout his human design. His hybrid form develops horns, claws, scales, and a tail while preserving his recognizable facial features. His dragon form is predominantly black with green witch-magic visible through portions of the scales.","outfitMaterials":["Leather","Cloth","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Watchful","Tense","Explosive"],"signatureOutfit":"Black layered street-fantasy clothing with a hooded jacket, fitted shirt, utility belts, dark trousers, and strapped combat boots.","distinguishingFeatures":["Rectangular pupils","Green magical markings"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:42:50.553656+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T16:42:50.553656+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing control","Hurting his allies","Being abandoned"],"goals":["Master his ash magic","Learn the truth about his parents","Reconcile with Ignis"],"beliefs":"","culture":["Old Way of Witches"],"lineage":"Ignis and Hecate","storyArc":"Ash begins as an emotionally unstable youth who understands neither his heritage nor the nature of his unusual ash abilities. His journey gradually exposes the truth of Etaceh''s identity as Hecate, Rahim''s role in saving him, and Ignis''s belief that his son had died. His growth centers on mastering his power and discovering that his separation from his family was not abandonment.","backstory":"AshóNodia was born to Ignis and Hecate, who lived under the hidden identity Etaceh. Following Hecate''s death, Rahim was compelled by her final spell to carry the infant Ash to his great-aunt in Whisperingdale. Ignis was left believing his youngest son had been lost. Ash eventually encountered Kaelen''s crew, where his uncontrolled power made Ylva''s Tranquil Hymn essential for calming his violent magical surges.","childhood":"After Hecate''s death, Ash was carried to safety under the influence of her final protective spell and delivered to his great-aunt. She raised him as Ashle and taught him within a community that preserved Hecate''s ancient magical traditions. Ash grew up unaware that Etaceh, the mother he knew of, was actually Hecate.","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Ash serves as Kaelen''s volatile heavy hitter and as a living bridge between the Dragon God-Primals and Hecate''s ancient witch lineage. His hidden parentage connects the crew directly to Ignis, Whisperingdale, and the lost history of Hecate.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Abandonment wounds","Difficulty regulating anger","Fear of losing control","Strong need for belonging"],"motivations":["Protect his crew","Understand his origins","Control his power","Find belonging"],"personality":["Melancholy","Watchful","Quiet","Volatile","Protective","Loyal","Hot-tempered","Isolated"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Birth to Ignis and Hecate\nDeath of Hecate\nRescue by Rahim\nArrival in Whisperingdale\nRaised by great-aunt\nJoined Kaelen''s crew"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"Kaelen\nYlva\nSax\nZafir","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Ignis\nHecate","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Rahim\nIfe\nEzra","worldConnections":"Ignis Peaks\nWhisperingdale\nUmbral Empire","relationshipNotes":"Ignis does not know what became of Ash after Hecate''s death. Hecate concealed her identity as Etaceh during her hidden life with Ignis. Rahim carried Ash to safety under Hecate''s final protective spell. Ash relies heavily on Ylva''s Tranquil Hymn when his emotional state overwhelms his control."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"d7fecdc3-89a1-49ab-8e00-3198d310e968","realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"1a437d0b-ed4f-49d2-8f8f-30c60eef7f74","faction_record_id":"f5492e8b-d617-44b1-bce7-517c90d1da55"}','2026-09-25T17:17:32.527371+00:00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id,entity_type,entity_id,entity_label,changed_by,changed_by_email,snapshot,created_at) VALUES ('975de378-e1b1-42e1-b12f-e3f2049a02b8','studio_characters','68184520-5c4b-48e9-a93b-668149340e3b','Ylva Morwenna de la Vega','db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745','Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com','{"id":"68184520-5c4b-48e9-a93b-668149340e3b","name":"Ylva Morwenna de la Vega","media":{"tbdFields":"Reference / Production Sheet\nAlternate / True Form","canonLocks":"Age 14\n5''1\" height\nOlive-pale skin\nDeep espresso near-black hair\nSlightly wavy hair\nExplorer''s braid\nIridescent violet gaze\nTraitor''s Glyph on shoulder\nSwirling iridescent aura\nPetite wiry build\nDark witch-explorer aesthetic","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Character Portrait establishes the current visual direction.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve Ylva''s youthful anime appearance, petite wiry build, olive-pale complexion, near-black braided hair, iridescent violet gaze, Traitor''s Glyph, dark witch-explorer clothing, ritual compass, and Umbral iridescence in future artwork.","referenceArtUrl":"","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"14","era":"","name":"Ylva Morwenna de la Vega","race":"Witch","alias":"The Gilded Prisoner","gender":"Female","titles":"","subrace":"","summary":"A prodigious young witch and fugitive from Whisperingdale whose obsession with forbidden magical knowledge led her to Umbral Genesis. Ylva approaches magic as an unexplored system that can be mapped, calculated, and improved. After two years imprisoned in the Whispering Spire, she escaped with two boys her age and became the strategic anchor of their group.","heritage":"Spanish","homeland":"Whisperingdale","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"Ylvie\nLittle Cartographer","occupation":"Witch","affiliation":"Belladonna Coven","apparentAge":"14","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"Whisperingdale","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Ritual compass","strengths":"Exceptional intelligence\nStrategic planning\nMagical precision\nRitual optimization\nAura analysis\nThree-step spell planning","weaknesses":"Limited physical strength\nRequires preparation\nVulnerable when rushed\nPrecision-dependent casting","combatStyle":["Calculated","Ritualistic","Strategic","Predictive","Seal-based"],"limitations":["Longer cast time","Complex rituals require accuracy","Traitor''s Glyph dampens earth connection"],"powerSource":["Witchcraft","Belladonna magic","Umbral exposure","Ritualism"],"abilityNotes":"Umbral exposure permanently altered Ylva''s magical resonance. Her spells can occasionally flicker in ways that bypass conventional magical shielding. Her iridescent gaze allows her to perceive magical auras as structures or patterns that she interprets like code.","combatProfile":"Ylva avoids direct physical confrontation and instead controls encounters through preparation, positioning, seals, and calculated spell sequences. She habitually plans several magical actions ahead. Her Umbral mutation can cause spells to flicker unpredictably through conventional magical defenses, but disruption of her concentration can severely reduce her effectiveness.","weaponDetails":"Ylva uses a ritualistic compass as both a navigation instrument and magical focusing tool. It assists with geometric ritual construction, veil calculations, and precise magical positioning.","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Calculated Ritualism\nRitual Circle Construction\nSeal Magic\nUmbral Manipulation\nAura Perception","secondaryAbilities":"Magical Analysis\nRitual Optimization\nVeil Piercing\nMagical Cartography\nAura Reading","signatureTechniques":"The Weaver''s Math\nUmbral Flicker","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Petite","Lean","Wiry","Agile"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"5''1\" (155 cm)","makeup":"","weight":"102 lbs (46 kg)","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Iridescent violet"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Olive-pale"],"wardrobe":"Layered ritual clothing\nExplorer clothing\nLaced boots","hairColor":["Deep espresso","Near-black"],"hairStyle":"Practical explorer''s braid","accessories":"Ritual compass\nSpellbook\nUtility pouches\nMapping tools","faceDetails":["Youthful features","Sharp attentive gaze"],"hairTexture":["Thick","Slightly wavy"],"colorPalette":"Near-black\nDeep espresso\nIridescent violet\nUmbral purple\nAntique gold","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Near-black\nCharcoal\nUmbral purple\nAntique gold","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"A practical fusion of witchcraft and explorer aesthetics. Her clothing favors layered dark fabrics, durable boots, utility belts, ritual markings, and equipment for carrying books, mapping tools, and magical components.","appearanceNotes":"Her prolonged confinement left her naturally warm Mediterranean complexion noticeably pale. Umbral exposure causes faint iridescent flickers around her hair and aura. The Traitor''s Glyph remains permanently branded on her shoulder.","outfitMaterials":["Leather","Woven cloth","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Stiff posture","Disciplined movement","Athletic grace"],"signatureOutfit":"Dark layered witch-explorer attire combining practical travel clothing with ritual garments, belts, pouches, occult detailing, and navigation-inspired accessories.","distinguishingFeatures":["Traitor''s Glyph","Swirling iridescent aura"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:41:17.011413+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T16:41:17.011413+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Permanent confinement","Loss of intellectual freedom"],"goals":["Decode Umbral Genesis","Understand the Between-Space","Complete her magical research"],"beliefs":["Magic can be mapped","Knowledge should be tested","Tradition requires proof","Magical limits can be surpassed"],"culture":["Belladonna Coven","Whisperingdale","Spanish seafaring heritage","Master explorer tradition"],"lineage":"Belladonna Coven and master explorer ancestry","storyArc":"Her story begins with intellectual rebellion and punishment for pursuing forbidden knowledge. Escape gives Ylva the freedom she wanted, but also forces her to confront the consequences of experimentation outside controlled conditions. Her connection to Umbral Genesis challenges her to determine whether knowledge should merely be discovered or also restrained.","backstory":"Ylva discovered the Vesper Ledger, a forbidden ancestral logbook containing coordinates connected to the Between-Space and Umbral Genesis. During a Blood Moon experiment, she pierced the veil and successfully captured Umbral energy, causing a powerful resonance throughout Whisperingdale. The experiment permanently mutated her aura. She was branded with the Traitor''s Glyph and imprisoned in the Whispering Spire for two years. At fourteen, two boys her age—one wielding voodoo power and another possessing Umbral Genesis—helped her escape, and she fled with them.","childhood":"Born to Chieftain Morwenna, Ylva showed an unusual fascination with geometry, stars, navigation, and magical structure. Rather than treating magic solely as a spiritual tradition, she approached it as an unexplored territory. By age nine, she was already correcting ancient ritual circles and improving their efficiency.","lifestyle":["Constant calculation","Magical research","Mapping","Ritual study","Strategic planning"],"storyRole":"Ylva serves as the intellectual and strategic anchor of her young fugitive group. Her knowledge of forbidden texts, ritualism, navigation, and Umbral phenomena allows her to interpret forces that her companions can wield but may not fully understand.","birthplace":"Whisperingdale","psychology":["Views magic as a system","Rejects unsupported tradition","Values intellectual freedom","Hides emotional vulnerability","Feels justified in her research"],"motivations":["Understand Umbral Genesis","Map unknown magic","Break magical limitations","Preserve intellectual freedom"],"personality":["Analytical","Calculated","Precise","Quietly defiant","Strategic","Blunt","Intellectually rebellious","Disciplined","Curious","Lonely"],"voiceSpeech":["Matter-of-fact","Precise","Blunt","Analytical"],"likesDislikes":["Ancient texts","Maps","Geometry","Stars","Magical research","Intellectual freedom","Dislikes unquestioned tradition","Dislikes confinement"],"majorLifeEvents":"Corrected ancient ritual circles\nDiscovered the Vesper Ledger\nResearched Umbral Genesis\nPierced the veil\nCaptured Umbral energy\nSuffered aura mutation\nBranded with the Traitor''s Glyph\nImprisoned in the Whispering Spire\nEscaped at age fourteen\nBecame a fugitive"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Chieftain Morwenna","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Whisperingdale\nWhispering Spire","relationshipNotes":"Ylva and Chieftain Morwenna share a painful bond shaped by love, law, and opposing philosophies of magic. Morwenna enforced Ylva''s imprisonment but later allowed the pursuit after her escape to remain deliberately weak. The Belladonna Coven elders fear Ylva''s magical development and regard her as a potential precursor to a new magical era."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"ec309b7f-d65a-4dca-af0b-846ed7318701","realm_record_id":"11533949-e0a1-4a62-aceb-25a09ba911da","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"0fede975-a6cd-4ec3-a649-6d2ed55c1863","faction_record_id":"7747ea2c-6d4f-4ff3-b0f3-c3cbda5ecd1a"}','2026-09-25T17:18:06.774288+00:00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id,entity_type,entity_id,entity_label,changed_by,changed_by_email,snapshot,created_at) VALUES ('47860ee5-6862-4391-8a66-860ee7dc2909','studio_characters','7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662','AshóNodia','db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745','Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com','{"id":"7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662","name":"AshóNodia","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nBirthplace\nHeight\nWeight\nDominant hand","canonLocks":"Age appearance 15–16\nSame loc hairstyle\nWarm brown skin\nEmerald green eyes\nRectangular pupils\nBlack layered clothing\nGreen witch magic\nAsh-based draconic power\nBlack Ash Dragon form","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing references establish Ash''s human, pseudo-dragon, and full Ash Dragon designs.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662/portrait/1790356618371-ash-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Use the established teenage production design as the primary reference. Ash should consistently appear approximately 15–16 years old. His magic visuals should emphasize black ash and green witch energy rather than conventional fire.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662/reference/1790356625725-ash-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662/alternate/1790356635134-ash-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"15–16","era":"","name":"AshóNodia","race":"Half Human + Half Dragon","alias":"Ashle","gender":"Male","titles":"The Ash Dragon\nThe Lost Son","subrace":"Dragonkin","summary":"AshóNodia is the hidden son of Ignis and Hecate. Raised under the name Ashle by his great-aunt, he inherited an unusual expression of his father''s draconic lineage: ash rather than conventional fire. His witch heritage allows him to magically ignite and manipulate that ash. Emotionally volatile and immensely powerful, Ash struggles with abandonment, belonging, and controlling abilities he was never properly taught to use.","heritage":"Duskari + Faelite","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"Ash","occupation":"","affiliation":"Kaelen''s Crew","apparentAge":"15–16","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":"Fire + Witch Magic"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Massive raw output\nArea control\nMagic disruption\nClose-range destruction\nDraconic durability\nAsh versatility","weaknesses":"Emotional instability\nPoor power control\nHigh collateral risk","combatStyle":["Aggressive","Instinctive","Area-of-effect","Close-range","Overwhelming force"],"limitations":["Does not naturally produce conventional fire","Power intensifies with emotion","Rampages impair judgment","Requires emotional regulation"],"powerSource":["Draconic blood","Hecate''s witch lineage","Ley-line magic"],"abilityNotes":"Despite being the son of Ignis, Ash does not display conventional fire-dragon properties. His inherited fire affinity manifests as ash, the residue of fire, rather than ordinary flame. Hecate''s witchcraft allows him to ignite the ash itself, producing burning enchanted ash without turning Ash into a conventional pyromancer.\n\nAshóNodia is his true name. His great-aunt gave him the everyday name Ashle, shortened to Ash.","combatProfile":"Ash fights through overwhelming pressure rather than refined technique. He floods the battlefield with ash, controls its movement through witchcraft, and can ignite it magically when attacking. His emotional state directly affects his control, making prolonged rage increasingly dangerous to allies and surroundings.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Pseudo Dragon Form\nAsh Dragon Form","primaryAbilities":"Ash Manipulation\nWitch-Ignited Ash\nFumemancy\nMagic Dampening","secondaryAbilities":"Smoke Manipulation\nSoot Manipulation\nEmber Manipulation\nAsh Solidification\nLey-Line Sensitivity\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Speed\nEnhanced Durability\nDraconic Senses","signatureTechniques":"Dragon''s Roar\nIncinerating Blast\nCinder Step\nVolcanic Burst\nAsh Cloud\nSilent Cinder Field","transformationDetails":"Ash''s pseudo form develops horns, black scales, claws, a tail, and increased draconic physical ability. His full dragon form becomes a massive black Ash Dragon surrounded by drifting ash and green witch energy. His draconic manifestation emphasizes ash rather than conventional flame."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Lean","Athletic"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Emerald green"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Hooded jackets\nDark fitted shirts\nUtility trousers\nCombat boots","hairColor":["Light brown"],"hairStyle":"Layered medium-length locs with loose face-framing strands","accessories":"Green pendant\nLayered necklaces\nUtility belts\nEar piercings","faceDetails":["Youthful angular face","Defined cheekbones"],"hairTexture":["Locs"],"colorPalette":"Black\nCharcoal\nAsh gray\nEmerald green\nEarth brown","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nCharcoal\nEmerald green","alternateForm":["Pseudo Dragon Form","Ash Dragon Form"],"clothingStyle":"Dark layered street-fantasy clothing built for movement and combat.","appearanceNotes":"Ash retains the same loc hairstyle throughout his human design. His hybrid form develops horns, claws, scales, and a tail while preserving his recognizable facial features. His dragon form is predominantly black with green witch-magic visible through portions of the scales.","outfitMaterials":["Leather","Cloth","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Watchful","Tense","Explosive"],"signatureOutfit":"Black layered street-fantasy clothing with a hooded jacket, fitted shirt, utility belts, dark trousers, and strapped combat boots.","distinguishingFeatures":["Rectangular pupils","Green magical markings"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:42:50.553656+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:17:32.527371+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing control","Hurting his allies","Being abandoned"],"goals":["Master his ash magic","Learn the truth about his parents","Reconcile with Ignis"],"beliefs":"","culture":["Old Way of Witches"],"lineage":"Ignis and Hecate","storyArc":"Ash begins as an emotionally unstable youth who understands neither his heritage nor the nature of his unusual ash abilities. His journey gradually exposes the truth of Etaceh''s identity as Hecate, Rahim''s role in saving him, and Ignis''s belief that his son had died. His growth centers on mastering his power and discovering that his separation from his family was not abandonment.","backstory":"AshóNodia was born to Ignis and Hecate, who lived under the hidden identity Etaceh. Following Hecate''s death, Rahim was compelled by her final spell to carry the infant Ash to his great-aunt in Whisperingdale. Ignis was left believing his youngest son had been lost. Ash eventually encountered Kaelen''s crew, where his uncontrolled power made Ylva''s Tranquil Hymn essential for calming his violent magical surges.","childhood":"After Hecate''s death, Ash was carried to safety under the influence of her final protective spell and delivered to his great-aunt. She raised him as Ashle and taught him within a community that preserved Hecate''s ancient magical traditions. Ash grew up unaware that Etaceh, the mother he knew of, was actually Hecate.","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Ash serves as Kaelen''s volatile heavy hitter and as a living bridge between the Dragon God-Primals and Hecate''s ancient witch lineage. His hidden parentage connects the crew directly to Ignis, Whisperingdale, and the lost history of Hecate.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Abandonment wounds","Difficulty regulating anger","Fear of losing control","Strong need for belonging"],"motivations":["Protect his crew","Understand his origins","Control his power","Find belonging"],"personality":["Melancholy","Watchful","Quiet","Volatile","Protective","Loyal","Hot-tempered","Isolated"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Birth to Ignis and Hecate\nDeath of Hecate\nRescue by Rahim\nArrival in Whisperingdale\nRaised by great-aunt\nJoined Kaelen''s crew"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662/portrait/1790356618371-ash-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Kaelen\nYlva\nSax\nZafir","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Ignis\nHecate","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Rahim\nIfe\nEzra","worldConnections":"Ignis Peaks\nWhisperingdale\nUmbral Empire","relationshipNotes":"Ignis does not know what became of Ash after Hecate''s death. Hecate concealed her identity as Etaceh during her hidden life with Ignis. Rahim carried Ash to safety under Hecate''s final protective spell. Ash relies heavily on Ylva''s Tranquil Hymn when his emotional state overwhelms his control."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"d7fecdc3-89a1-49ab-8e00-3198d310e968","realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"1a437d0b-ed4f-49d2-8f8f-30c60eef7f74","faction_record_id":"f5492e8b-d617-44b1-bce7-517c90d1da55"}','2026-09-25T17:18:41.611409+00:00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id,entity_type,entity_id,entity_label,changed_by,changed_by_email,snapshot,created_at) VALUES ('f6ca37b7-98a9-47b8-8223-c5fd5a3e6ece','studio_characters','7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4','Rahim','db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745','Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com','{"id":"7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4","name":"Rahim","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nAge\nHeight\nWeight\nCurrent residence\nCurrent whereabouts\nOccupation\nAffiliation","canonLocks":"Mixed Black and Asian heritage\nDeep warm-brown skin\nBlack hair\nCrimson eyes\nTall muscular build\nBlack and crimson palette\nBlood-crystal aesthetic\nObsidian-black dragon scales\nGlowing crimson dragon veins\nAnime visual style","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"The Reference / Production Sheet is the primary continuity reference for future Rahim artwork. Blood Dragon and blood-crystallization references establish his alternate-form visual language.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4/portrait/1790356514399-rahim-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nBlood Crystallization Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Use the established anime production sheet as Rahim''s primary visual reference. Preserve his mixed Black and Asian facial identity, dark skin, black hair, crimson eyes, muscular build, black-and-crimson wardrobe, blood-crystal aesthetic, and established Blood Dragon design.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4/reference/1790356521344-rahim-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4/alternate/1790356526948-rahim-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Rahim","race":"Elemental Dragon","alias":"The Blood Dragon","gender":"Male","titles":"Crimson Blood Dragon","subrace":"Blood Dragon","summary":"Rahim is the firstborn Blood Dragon of Ignis and Leviathans. Fire and Water manifest through him as chaotic blood magic, allowing him to manipulate life force, weaponize blood, and crystallize it into devastating constructs. Battle-hungry and arrogant, he considers many less destructive elemental powers beneath his own.","heritage":"Black + Asian","homeland":"Ignis Peaks","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":"Fire + Water"},"abilities":{"weapons":"Blood-crystal weapons","strengths":"Extreme destructive power\nBattlefield control\nVersatile blood constructs\nLife-force absorption\nBlood-crystal durability\nAggression amplification","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Aggressive","Overwhelming","Close-range combat","Battlefield domination","Construct-based combat"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Fire","Water","Blood","Life force"],"abilityNotes":"Hemocrystal Dominion allows Rahim to condense manipulated blood into extremely hard crimson crystal for armor, weapons, spikes, and constructs. Bloodlust Amplification intensifies aggression and fighting spirit around him. Life-Force Siphon draws vitality from others, while Heart of the Battlefield allows spilled blood across a battlefield to become material for his constructs.","combatProfile":"Rahim thrives in prolonged, chaotic battles where blood and aggression are abundant. He combines direct physical combat with life-force manipulation, blood constructs, crystallized weapons, and large-scale battlefield control. His presence can intensify aggression around him, making an already violent conflict increasingly unstable.","weaponDetails":"Rahim crystallizes blood into blades, spears, shields, whips, armor, and other combat constructs. The weapons can be formed rapidly from manipulated blood and reshaped during battle.","transformations":"Blood Dragon Form\nCrimson Tyrant State","primaryAbilities":"Chaotic Blood Magic\nBlood Manipulation\nBlood Crystallization\nLife-Force Siphon\nBloodlust Amplification","secondaryAbilities":"Blood Construct Creation\nBlood-Crystal Armor\nBlood-Crystal Weaponry\nBlood-Crystal Regeneration","signatureTechniques":"Hemocrystal Dominion\nHeart of the Battlefield\nBlood Spear Storm","transformationDetails":"Rahim''s Blood Dragon Form has obsidian-black scales threaded with glowing crimson veins, scarlet eyes, blood-crystal structures, and wings formed through dark draconic tissue, blood mist, and crystal. In Crimson Tyrant State, blood crystallization spreads across his body as dense crimson armor, enlarging his horns, claws, spikes, and other natural weapons."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Crimson — #A20D1A"],"height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #111014"],"skinHex":["Deep Brown — #704936"],"eyeColor":["Crimson red"],"grooming":"Clean-shaven","skinTone":["Deep warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Long black coat\nDark trousers\nCombat boots","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Tousled medium-length hair","accessories":"Crimson pendant\nEarrings\nLayered chains\nRings","faceDetails":["Sharp jawline","High cheekbones","Strong brows"],"hairTexture":["Wavy","Thick"],"colorPalette":"Blood Crimson — #8A0712\nObsidian Black — #111014\nDeep Garnet — #5E101B\nMolten Scarlet — #D4232E","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nCrimson\nDark red\nMetallic silver","alternateForm":["Blood Dragon Form","Crimson Tyrant State"],"clothingStyle":"Dark, regal battlewear combining draconic ornamentation with a dangerous and aristocratic silhouette.","appearanceNotes":"Rahim''s human design reflects his Black paternal and Asian maternal heritage. His established visual identity uses black, crimson, and blood-crystal accents. His dragon form is covered in obsidian-black scales threaded with glowing crimson veins and increasingly develops crystalline structures as his blood crystallization intensifies.","outfitMaterials":["Dark fabric","Leather","Metal","Blood crystal"],"postureMovement":["Confident","Predatory","Commanding"],"signatureOutfit":"Black battle attire with crimson accents, an open chest, layered dark fabrics, metallic detailing, and blood-crystal ornamentation.","distinguishingFeatures":["Dragon markings","Blood-crystal formations"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:43:10.905895+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:16:43.882164+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":["Power should be fully expressed"],"culture":"","lineage":"Firstborn of Ignis and Leviathans","storyArc":"Rahim''s established history connects him directly to Ash''s survival. After carrying out Hecate''s protective spell and delivering Ash to safety, he vanished under circumstances tied to altered memories, leaving his family without clear knowledge of his fate.","backstory":"Rahim is the eldest child of Ignis and Leviathans, with Fire and Water manifesting through him as Blood rather than Steam. He later carried out Hecate''s protective memory spell and delivered the infant Ash safely to Hecate''s great-aunt. Rahim subsequently vanished, leaving his whereabouts unknown and his memories altered.","childhood":"Rahim was raised at Ignis Peaks and developed a strong combat bond with Ignis.","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Rahim is the volatile eldest sibling whose immense destructive potential contrasts sharply with the more controlled elemental expressions of his family. His disappearance and altered memories leave his current role unresolved.","birthplace":"Ignis Peaks","psychology":["Craves intense combat","Disdains weaker powers","Seeks powerful opponents"],"motivations":["Experience intense combat","Fully express his power"],"personality":["Battle-hungry","Chaotic","Arrogant","Destructive","Possessive"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":["Likes battle","Likes powerful opponents","Dislikes restrained power"],"majorLifeEvents":"Raised at Ignis Peaks\nBonded with Ignis through combat\nProtected infant Ash\nDelivered Ash to Hecate''s great-aunt\nMemories altered\nDisappeared"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4/portrait/1790356514399-rahim-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Ignis\nLeviathans","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Ife\nEzra\nRuchika\nAsh","worldConnections":"Ignis Peaks","relationshipNotes":"Ife shares both parents with Rahim and manifests the same Fire and Water lineage as Steam rather than Blood. Rahim protected Ash as an infant and delivered Ash safely to Hecate''s great-aunt before disappearing."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f6cff800-4029-4f02-b391-098583082feb","realm_record_id":"97d4dc51-d1bf-4f80-9e77-3955ba9dad35","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"7f13ea09-709b-4aff-8d52-e65832afb12b","faction_record_id":null}','2026-09-25T17:19:11.305389+00:00');
